ext to the switch and ",[311,340,341],{},"description"," the text below it. It shows on one line and is truncated when wider than its container. A tooltip shows the full text on hover or focus, or on long press on touch devices (see ",[344,345,217],"a",{"href":346},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fhelper\u002Ftooltip#touch-long-press","), the same as the ",[344,349,351],{"href":350},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fchoice\u002Fcheckbox#label","checkbox",". The description wraps: without one the height matches an input, and with one the switch grows while its first line still lines up with fields next to it.",[354,355],"component-example",{"name":356},"switch-basic",[329,358,359],{"id":317},"Action",[308,361,362,364],{},[311,363,317],{}," runs after toggling, receives the new value and may return a Promise. Use it for settings that are saved through an API as soon as they change, such as enabling an account or notifications.",[354,366],{"name":367},"switch-action",[369,370,371,394],"table",{},[372,373,374],"thead",{},[375,376,377,381,383,388],"tr",{},[378,379,380],"th",{},"Stage",[378,382,152],{},[378,384,385],{},[311,386,387],{},"v-model",[378,389,390,393],{},[311,391,392],{},"change"," event",[395,396,397,412,426,438],"tbody",{},[375,398,399,403,406,409],{},[400,401,402],"td",{},"Pending",[400,404,405],{},"Shows the new value, loading and disabled",[400,407,408],{},"Unchanged",[400,410,411],{},"Not emitted",[375,413,414,417,420,423],{},[400,415,416],{},"Success",[400,418,419],{},"Keeps the new value, loading and disabled end",[400,421,422],{},"Updated to the new value",[400,424,425],{},"Emitted",[375,427,428,431,434,436],{},[400,429,430],{},"Failure",[400,432,433],{},"Goes back to the old value, loading and disabled end",[400,435,408],{},[400,437,411],{},[375,439,440,443,446,448],{},[400,441,442],{},"Error",[400,444,445],{},"Same as failure",[400,447,408],{},[400,449,411],{},[451,452,453,470,487,495],"ul",{},[454,455,456,459,460,463,464,466,467,322],"li",{},[457,458,416],"strong",{},": only returning ",[311,461,462],{},"false"," (or a Promise resolving to ",[311,465,462],{},") counts as a failure. Any other value is a success, including no return value as in ",[311,468,469],{},"async () => { await save(value) }",[454,471,472,475,476,479,480,483,484,486],{},[457,473,474],{},"Errors",": when the action throws, the switch reverts the same way and the error is thrown again, for the global error handler or the console. To notify the user, ",[311,477,478],{},"try","\u002F",[311,481,482],{},"catch"," inside the action, show a message and return ",[311,485,462],{},", as in the example above.",[454,488,489,491,492,494],{},[457,490,402],{},": the switch is disabled, so the action is not called twice. If the page changes ",[311,493,387],{}," while pending, the page's value wins and is not overwritten when the action finishes.",[454,496,497,502,503,505,506,322],{},[457,498,499,500],{},"Without ",[311,501,317],{},", ",[311,504,387],{}," updates right after toggling, the same as ",[311,507,321],{},[308,509,510,511,514,515,518,519,322],{},"The ",[311,512,513],{},"SwitchAction"," and ",[311,516,517],{},"SwitchValue"," types can be imported from ",[311,520,521],{},"#shuo-ui\u002Fcomponents\u002FShuoSwitch.vue",[329,523,525],{"id":524},"on-and-off-values","On and off values",[308,527,528,514,531,534,535,514,538,540,541,479,544,547],{},[311,529,530],{},"true-value",[311,532,533],{},"false-value"," are the bound values when on and off, ",[311,536,537],{},"true",[311,539,462],{}," by default. Change them when the back end uses ",[311,542,543],{},"Y",[311,545,546],{},"N","; the action receives these values too.",[354,549],{"name":550},"switch-values",[329,552,554],{"id":553},"size-and-states","Size and states",[308,556,557,558,561,562,565,566,569,570,573,574,577,578,581,582,585,586,589,590,594],{},"When ",[311,559,560],{},"size"," is not set, it follows the ",[311,563,564],{},"UFormField"," size and the site-wide setting, ",[311,567,568],{},"lg"," built in, the same 